known gaps on this host, NOT defects in this binary:
  * gate-cli's arm64 checks fail on Linux — the arm64 backend emits Mach-O and the
    GNU linker rejects it ("file format not recognized"). 6 checks; macOS-only.
  * gate-cli's sanitizer checks need clang's runtime libs from the SAME llvm-config
    the compiler resolves. Put /usr/lib/llvm-21/bin first on PATH, or a stray
    /usr/local llvm-config silently selects a clang whose libclang_rt is absent.
